<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Social Distancing Infographic</title>
<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #222;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    .poster {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 900px;
        background-color: #16164a;
        color: #ffffff;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 50px 20px;
        gap: 20px;
    }
    .dashed-line {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .dashed-line .line {
        width: 120px;
        border-bottom: 2px dashed #f29c1f;
    }
    .dashed-line.left .arrow {
        width: 0; height: 0;
        border-top: 4px solid transparent;
        border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
        border-right: 8px solid #f29c1f;
    }
    .dashed-line.right .arrow {
        width: 0; height: 0;
        border-top: 4px solid transparent;
        border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
        border-left: 8px solid #f29c1f;
    }
    .title-text {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 15px;
    }
    .title-social {
        font-family: 'Brush Script MT', cursive;
        font-size: 72px;
        line-height: 1;
    }
    .title-distancing {
        font-size: 42px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
    }

    /* Main Content Split */
    .content-split {
        display: flex;
    }
    .col-left {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 40px 50px;
        background-color: #16164a;
    }
    .col-right {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 40px 50px;
        background-color: #0f4c81;
    }

    /* Typography */
    .section-title {
        color: #f29c1f;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin: 20px 0 15px 0;
        line-height: 1.4;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .text-body {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .text-body strong {
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* Placeholders & Icons */
    .placeholder {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    .icon-circle-large {
        width: 70px;
        height: 70px;
        background-color: #f29c1f;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: #16164a;
        font-size: 10px;
    }

    /* Right Column Specifics */
    .right-header-wrap {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .right-header-wrap .section-title {
        margin: 0;
    }
    .list-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
    }
    .list-icon {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border: 2px solid #8ba6c1;
        border-radius: 5px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        color: #8ba6c1;
        font-size: 9px;
    }

    /* Bottom Area */
    .bottom-area {
        background-color: #1d1848;
        padding: 40px 50px;
    }
    .bottom-header-wrap {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .icon-square-outline {
        width: 50px;
        height: 50px;
        border: 2px solid #f29c1f;
        border-radius: 8px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        color: #f29c1f;
        font-size: 10px;
    }
    .bottom-area .text-body {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .bottom-area .text-body:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
        background-color: #1d1848;
        padding: 0 50px 40px 50px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .sources {
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #8ba6c1;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .sources strong {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 11px;
    }
    .visme-box {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .visme-made {
        font-family: 'Brush Script MT', cursive;
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    .visme-logo-wrap {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .visme-logo-placeholder {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        background-color: #333;
        border-radius: 50%;
        font-size: 8px;
    }
    .visme-brand {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -1px;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="poster">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="dashed-line left">
            <div class="arrow"></div>
            <div class="line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="title-text">
            <span class="title-social">Social</span>
            <span class="title-distancing">DISTANCING</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dashed-line right">
            <div class="line"></div>
            <div class="arrow"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="content-split">
        <!-- Left Column -->
        <div class="col-left">
            <div class="icon-circle-large placeholder">[Icon:<br>Double Arrow]</div>
            <div class="section-title">WHAT IS SOCIAL<br>DISTANCING?</div>
            <p class="text-body">Social distancing, also called physical distancing, is a form of <strong>non-pharmaceutical intervention</strong>, which downtrends the spread of contagious diseases simply by <strong>keeping people "apart" from each other.</strong></p>

            <div style="height: 50px;"></div>

            <div class="icon-circle-large placeholder">[Icon:<br>Exclamation]</div>
            <div class="section-title">WHY IS SOCIAL<br>DISTANCING IMPORTANT?</div>
            <p class="text-body">It prevents contact between infected and uninfected <strong>individuals, resulting in reduced disease transmission</strong> and less deaths from fatal diseases.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column -->
        <div class="col-right">
            <div class="right-header-wrap">
                <div class="icon-circle-large placeholder" style="flex-shrink: 0;">[Icon:<br>Checkmark]</div>
                <div class="section-title">BEST PRACTICES FOR<br>SOCIAL DISTANCING</div>
            </div>

            <div class="list-item">
                <div class="list-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>House]</div>
                <p class="text-body"><strong>Self/Home Quarantine: Stay home.</strong> Only go out if it's very essential, that too with protection (gloves, masks, sanitizers)</p>
            </div>

            <div class="list-item">
                <div class="list-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>People]</div>
                <p class="text-body">Avoid public gatherings as much as possible</p>
            </div>

            <div class="list-item">
                <div class="list-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Store]</div>
                <p class="text-body">Keep spots susceptible to mass gatherings like <strong>parks, malls, food courts, restaurants and schools closed.</strong> Restaurants can be instructed to follow a "Takeaway" only system until the situation relaxes</p>
            </div>

            <div class="list-item">
                <div class="list-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Ruler]</div>
                <p class="text-body">Maintain a distance of <strong>at least 1 - 2 meters (3 to 6 feet) from other individuals</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="list-item">
                <div class="list-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Handshake]</div>
                <p class="text-body">Avoid shaking hands and embracing one another</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Area -->
    <div class="bottom-area">
        <div class="bottom-header-wrap">
            <div class="icon-square-outline placeholder">[Icon:<br>Graph]</div>
            <div class="section-title" style="margin: 0;">SOCIAL DISTANCING IN THE TIME<br>OF COVID-19: FLATTENING THE CURVE</div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-body">For a disease like COVID-19, which spreads through air droplets from sneezing and coughing, scientists have claimed that <strong>social distancing might "flatten the curve".</strong></p>
        <p class="text-body">This means that if proper social distancing protocols are followed, the spread of the disease will <strong>slow down and relieve health care professionals and medical centers</strong> of the burden of providing aid to hundreds of patients at a time, which is not feasible.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="sources">
            <strong>SOURCE:</strong><br>
            https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_distancing<br>
            https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public<br>
            https://www.vox.com/2020/3/15/21179296/coronavirus-covid-19-social-distancing-bored-pandemic-quarantine-ethics
        </div>
        <div class="visme-box">
            <div class="visme-made">Made with</div>
            <div class="visme-logo-wrap">
                <div class="visme-logo-placeholder placeholder">[Logo]</div>
                <div class="visme-brand">visme</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
